# Overrides the root .dockerignore for `-f web/Dockerfile` builds only.
#
# BuildKit gives <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore precedence over the root file.
# Necessary because the root one excludes web/ outright -- correct for the API
# image, fatal for this one. One build context, two images, opposite needs.

**/.env
**/.env.*

# The backend is a separate image. Its venv alone is 166 MB.
backend/

# node_modules is reinstalled from the lockfile inside the image, and .next is
# rebuilt. Copying either would be slower AND wrong: a host-built .next can
# contain absolute paths and native binaries for the wrong platform.
web/node_modules/
web/.next/

.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
infra/
mobile-android/
mobile-ios/
*.md
